1
00:00:00,524 --> 00:00:01,994
(Penny:)Okay, I'll go to a hotel.

2
00:00:01,992 --> 00:00:04,462
(Penny:)Text me in the morning
if you're still alive.

3
00:00:07,097 --> 00:00:08,127
(Leonard:)Uh, Theodore,

4
00:00:08,132 --> 00:00:09,362
(Leonard:)how long

5
00:00:09,366 --> 00:00:11,836
(Leonard:)are you planning
to stay exactly?

6
00:00:11,835 --> 00:00:14,335
(Theodore:)Oh, thanks to the coins
I found in your couch,

7
00:00:14,338 --> 00:00:16,908
(Theodore:)a day longer than I thought.

8
00:00:17,708 --> 00:00:19,538
(Leonard:)This is ridiculous.

9
00:00:22,246 --> 00:00:24,346
(Theodore:)I like the painting.

10
00:00:24,348 --> 00:00:26,448
(Theodore:)Is that your mom?

11
00:00:31,055 --> 00:00:33,825
Sheldon, get out here!

12
00:00:34,625 --> 00:00:36,225
(Sheldon:)Will you keep it down?

13
00:00:36,226 --> 00:00:37,896
(Sheldon:)What kind of vengeful
bed and breakfast

14
00:00:37,895 --> 00:00:40,065
(Sheldon:)do you think I'm running?

15
00:00:40,064 --> 00:00:42,634
(Leonard:)We lived together
13 years.

16
00:00:42,633 --> 00:00:43,933
(Leonard:)How can you be so awful to me?

17
00:00:43,934 --> 00:00:45,364
I'm being awful?!

18
00:00:45,369 --> 00:00:47,439
(Sheldon:)You're the one who went
out of your way to hurt me.

19
00:00:47,438 --> 00:00:48,668
(Leonard:)Because you were
being selfish.

20
00:00:48,672 --> 00:00:50,972
(Sheldon:)Dividing our belongings
is difficult.

21
00:00:50,975 --> 00:00:52,775
(Leonard:)Why?
I said I didn't care!

22
00:00:52,776 --> 00:00:54,246
(Theodore:)Excuse me.

23
00:00:54,244 --> 00:00:57,414
(Theodore:)It's none of my business,
but it sounds like a lot

24
00:00:57,414 --> 00:01:03,024
(Theodore:)of this anger
is coming from love.

